OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain, some
OL,6,Fheavy, will move southeastwards
OL,7,Fovernight from Northern Ireland and
OL,8,Fsouthern Scotland to affect northern
OL,9,FEngland, Wales and later central and
OL,10,Fsouthwestern parts of England. Clearer
OL,11,Ffurther north with blustery showers.
OL,12,FDrier, but increasingly cloudy and
OL,13,Fhumid further southeast.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FA weakening band of rain, with
OL,16,Fbrisk winds will clear southeastwards
OL,17,Ffrom southern England and Wales,
OL,18,Fleaving a brighter, fresher day here.
OL,19,FVery blustery further north, with
OL,20,Fsunshine and showers.
